Changelog: 17-10-2026 13:24:38

Release 0.2.1.

Changelog: 17-10-2026 13:05:02

Fixed. The app's folder in the suite is apps/shadps4 (was apps/shadps4-manager) and its package is shadps4_manager
(was bc250_shadps4_manager): the suite's naming convention (owner, 17-10-2026), a short folder name and the package
named after the app without the BC-250 prefix; both names are the owner's. With the folder go its key in the
portal, its chapter of the wiki (apps/shadps4/, which the Manual link opens), its installer test and its release
tags: shadps4-v<x.y.z> from the next release on, which the app's update check follows. The installed app keeps its
name, its launchers bc250-shadps4-manager and bc250-shadps4-pkg-cli (which the installer writes with the package's
new name), the run wrapper bc250-shadps4-run that the Steam shortcuts start, its folder and venv under
~/.local/share with the installed shadPS4, and its settings; the portal moves its record of the installed copy to
the new key.

